d across two slots via softmax function. For a given frame pair (i, j), their relative flow I\u0303i\u2192j can be computed via:\nI\u0303i\u2192j = 2\u2211 s=1 \u03b1si\u2192j \u2297 I\u0303si\u2192j , (7)\nwhere \u2297 denotes the element-wise multiplication. At inference time, we adopt the binarized opacity weights \u03b1s as the object segmentation masks."
